---
import Section from './Section.astro';
// The three differentiators, in spirit from PRICING.md §1 (end of section):
// free hardware-life tracking · cited-or-it-doesn't-ship · own-your-data / self-hostable.
const points = [
  {
    n: '01',
    title: 'Tracking is free, for the life of the strap',
    body: 'Every metric, chart, baseline, and personal finding is free forever. We don’t sell the strap, and we won’t rent your own data back to you with a subscription. The hardware is yours; so are the numbers.',
    tag: 'no forced subscription',
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    title: 'If it can’t back a claim, it stays quiet',
    body: 'Before any interpretation reaches you, it’s checked against a library of graded research. A claim that can’t be sourced isn’t softened for you — it’s dropped.',
    tag: 'cited, or it doesn’t ship',
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    title: 'Your data, on your terms',
    body: 'You can run the whole thing yourself on one small server, with your full history kept on your phone and backed up off-box. Own-your-data isn’t a slogan here; it’s the architecture.',
    tag: 'self-hostable',
  },
];
---

<Section id="different" labelledby="different-h">
  <h2 id="different-h" class="rise mt-4 max-w-3xl text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,3rem)]">
    Every other health app cheers you on. This one tells you the truth.
  </h2>
  <p class="lede rise mt-6 max-w-2xl">
    Streaks, green rings, and praise you didn’t earn keep you tapping. Healthee is the friend who
    tells you the truth kindly — and it’s built on three things no one else does all at once.
  </p>

  <ol class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-3">
    {
      points.map((p) => (
        <li class="rise flex flex-col bg-canvas p-7">
          <span class="mono text-sm text-accent-soft">{p.n}</span>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl leading-snug">{p.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 grow text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">{p.body}</p>
          <span class="chip chip-accent mt-6 self-start">{p.tag}</span>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>

  <p class="rise mt-8 max-w-2xl text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-faint">
    The big trackers ship AI coaches too — none of them show you where their advice comes from. The
    sections that follow show, rather than tell, why ours has to.
  </p>
</Section>
